    <string name="about_body">Wi-Fi and Bluetooth counts show saved observations, including repeat sightings. Wi-Fi and BLE locations are matched to signal measurement time; only observations with usable GPS coordinates are retained. Distance is estimated from location fixes. Android may throttle radio scans.\n\nRecordings are encrypted on this device. CSV exports are unencrypted. Maps request tiles from OpenStreetMap, which receives the requested map area and your network address.</string>
